OL,3,GNEWSAThree murder suspects bailed over 
OL,4,Aman's death                            
OL,6,FTwo men and a woman arrested on        
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder following the death
OL,8,Fof a man have been released on police  
OL,9,Fbail.                                  
OL,11,FDorset Police said officers were sent  
OL,12,Fto Frances Road, Bournemouth on        
OL,13,FThursday at about 18:00 GMT after      
OL,14,Freports a man had been found injured at
OL,15,Fan address. The 71-year-old man from   
OL,16,Fthe town, was later confirmed dead at  
OL,17,Fthe scene.                             
