OL,3,GNEWSAThree murder suspects bailed over 
OL,4,Aman's death                            
OL,6,FTwo men aged 51 and 43, and a          
OL,7,F34-year-old woman, all from Bournemouth
OL,8,Fwere arrested on suspicion of murder.  
OL,9,FThe woman was also arrested on         
OL,10,Fsuspicion of possession of a controlled
OL,11,FClass A drug.                          
OL,13,FPolice say all three have since been   
OL,14,Freleased on police bail as             
OL,15,Finvestigations continue.               
